uEmacs/PK (torvalds/uemacs 325a8e9) on Sage040, against picolibc.

- tcap.c: termcap from <termcap.h> -- libc/termcap, the one terminal
  compiled in -- rather than from ncurses' <curses.h> and <term.h>.
- itoa renamed ue_itoa throughout: picolibc's <stdlib.h> declares an
  itoa of its own with a different signature.
- posix.c: OLCUC, XCASE, ECHOCTL, ECHOPRT, ECHOKE, FLUSHO and PENDIN
  are Linux's and BSD's, not POSIX's, and picolibc does not define
  them; each is cleared only where it exists.

